/F1 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 760 Tm (Tenacious Conversion Engine — Act V Memo) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 744 Tm (Page 2/2 — The Skeptic’s Appendix) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 728 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 72 712 Tm (A\) Four failure modes τ²-Bench does not capture \(what / why τ² misses / what to add / cost\):) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 696 Tm (1\) Wrong-signal outreach \(signal_overclaiming\):) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 680 Tm (   What: agent asserts hiring/AI/funding claims from weak public signal.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 664 Tm (   Why τ² misses: τ² retail tasks do not exercise public-signal grounding for real companies.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 648 Tm (   Add: enforce confidence-tier phrasing + abstention when confidence < 0.6; add probe gates.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 632 Tm (   Cost: lower throughput; requires more enrichment checks per prospect.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 616 Tm (2\) Tone/brand offense \(offshore language triggers\):) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 600 Tm (   What: phrasing that reads like low-quality outsourcing spam.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 584 Tm (   Why τ² misses: retail benchmark has no brand sensitivity or founder persona risk.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 568 Tm (   Add: style-guide rubric + red-flag phrase filters + human review for first 50 sends.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 552 Tm (   Cost: review time; false positives can reduce volume.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 536 Tm (3\) Booking proxy mismatch \(booking_created ≠ qualified\):) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 520 Tm (   What: system can get replies but fail the booking proxy due to tooling mismatch.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 504 Tm (   Why τ² misses: τ² tasks are closed-form; no real calendar / sales workflow variance.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 488 Tm (   Add: align qualification to Tenacious CRM stages; instrument post-reply handoff.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 472 Tm (   Cost: HubSpot stage mapping + ops time.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 456 Tm (4\) Competitive-gap benchmark mismatch:) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 440 Tm (   What: “top-quartile practice” may be irrelevant or strategically wrong for a prospect.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 424 Tm (   Why τ² misses: benchmark is not conditioned on sub-niche strategy constraints.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 408 Tm (   Add: ask a calibration question before prescribing; allow ‘deliberate choice’ escape hatch.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 392 Tm (   Cost: longer emails; slightly lower reply rates expected.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 376 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 72 360 Tm (B\) Public-signal lossiness \(false negatives / false positives\):) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 344 Tm (False negative: quietly sophisticated but silent company → scorer underestimates readiness → overly basic pitch → lost deal.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 328 Tm (False positive: loud but shallow company → scorer overestimates readiness → over-technical pitch → brand damage + lower replies.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 312 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 72 296 Tm (C\) Gap-analysis risks \(when top-quartile is a bad benchmark\):) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 280 Tm (Risk 1: deliberate strategy \(e.g., regulated workflow where ‘move fast’ practices are harmful\) → wrong recommendation harms trust.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 264 Tm (Risk 2: sub-niche irrelevance \(capability gap is not binding constraint\) → prospect ignores message and categorizes as spam.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 248 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 72 232 Tm (D\) Brand-reputation comparison \(unit economics\):) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 216 Tm (Assume 1,000 emails sent; if 5% contain a wrong signal, that's 50 wrong-signal emails.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 200 Tm (If each wrong-signal email has an expected reputation cost of $10k in pipeline suppression, expected brand cost = $500k.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 184 Tm (Compare to expected reply-rate lift in the 7–12% range \(vs 1–3% baseline\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 168 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 72 152 Tm (E\) One honest unresolved probe \(business impact if deployed anyway\):) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 136 Tm (Probe: signal_overclaiming \(P-005\): assertive Segment 1 opener regardless of confidence \(measured trigger rate 9/9\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 120 Tm (Impact: undermines the core ‘grounded research’ value prop; can revert reply rates to baseline and create viral brand risk.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 104 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 72 88 Tm (F\) Kill switch clause \(metric / threshold / rollback condition\):) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 72 Tm (Metric: wrong-signal rate on manually audited sample of first 100 sends.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 56 Tm (Threshold: pause if wrong-signal rate ≥ 5% or any single high-severity false claim triggers an executive complaint.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 40 Tm (Rollback: revert to generic pitch template + require human approval for signal-grounded claims until fixed.) Tj
ET
